    ["B1", "Les restes sont au frigo ; réchauffez-les au micro-ondes pendant deux minutes.", ["The leftovers are in the fridge. Heat them up in the microwave for two minutes.","There are leftovers in the fridge — reheat them in the microwave for two minutes.","The leftovers are in the fridge; warm them up in the microwave for two minutes.","Leftovers are in the fridge. Put them in the microwave for two minutes."], [["leftover*"],["fridge"],["microwave"],["two","2"]], ["Il reste de la nourriture au frigo ; faites-la chauffer deux minutes au micro-ondes.","Les restes sont dans le frigo ; réchauffez-les deux minutes au micro-ondes."], [["restes","reste"],["frigo*","refrigerateur","frigidaire"],["micro onde*"],["deux","2"]], "« leftovers » est toujours au pluriel."]
